@startuml Tambah_Ke_Keranjang
!theme plain
title SD: Tambah ke Keranjang
actor Customer
participant "App (Flutter)" as App
participant "CartProvider\n(Local State)" as Cart

note over Cart: Keranjang disimpan lokal\n(tidak ada API — dikirim saat checkout)

Customer -> App: Pilih produk, layanan & jumlah
App -> App: Cek stok (Beli Baru / Sewa)

alt Stok habis
    App --> Customer: Tombol "Habis" — tidak bisa tambah
else Stok tersedia / Isi Ulang
    App -> Cart: addToCart(product, service, qty)
    Cart --> App: Item tersimpan di state
    App --> Customer: SnackBar "Produk ditambahkan"
    App --> Customer: Badge keranjang diperbarui
end

@enduml
